  "answer_type": "grounded_answer",
  "answer": "The intensity of PTSD is established using clinically validated assessment tools that categorize the risk level based on weekly PTSD assessment scores. If a veteran's scores exceed the threshold for all three tools, they are considered at high risk; if they exceed for two, they are at moderate risk; and if they exceed for one, they are at low risk [E2][E4][E6].",
  "citations": ["E2", "E4", "E6"],
